  "Solution": {
    "S": "At $A(5, 5)$: $z = 550(5) + 300(5) = 2750 + 1500 = 4250$.\n\nAt $B(5, 10)$: $z = 550(5) + 300(10) = 2750 + 3000 = 5750$.\n\nAt $C(11, 4)$: $z = 550(11) + 300(4) = 6050 + 1200 = 7250$.\n\nAt $D(6, 4)$: $z = 550(6) + 300(4) = 3300 + 1200 = 4500$.\n\nThe maximum value is 7250 at point $C(11, 4)$. Hence the correct option is A: 7250."
